Type: project
Title: STATS600 Weather Forecasting Project
Description: R packages used by the project environment. Depends lists the R
    version. Imports lists the base R packages the analysis code calls
    (stats for arima/lm/predict, graphics and grDevices for plots, utils),
    tidyverse for data wrangling and ggplot2 graphics,
    then the Jupyter R kernel (IRkernel) and every package it needs, then renv.
    Exact versions are pinned in renv.lock; update both files together.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    utils,
    tidyverse,
    IRkernel (>= 1.3.2),
    base64enc (>= 0.1-6),
    cli (>= 3.6.6),
    crayon (>= 1.5.3),
    digest (>= 0.6.39),
    evaluate (>= 1.0.5),
    fastmap (>= 1.2.0),
    glue (>= 1.8.1),
    htmltools (>= 0.5.9),
    IRdisplay (>= 1.1),
    jsonlite (>= 2.0.0),
    lifecycle (>= 1.0.5),
    pbdZMQ (>= 0.3-14),
    pillar (>= 1.11.1),
    repr (>= 1.1.7),
    rlang (>= 1.3.0),
    utf8 (>= 1.2.6),
    uuid (>= 1.2-2),
